1
00:00:14,653 --> 00:00:16,054
She has a
baby back there

2
00:00:16,094 --> 00:00:18,936
and the neo Nazis
are planning to burn the town

3
00:00:20,978 --> 00:00:24,180
A Turkish woman
was found dead up on the third floor

4
00:00:27,281 --> 00:00:31,213
We're approaching
the meeting place where Johann will be expecting you

5
00:00:31,416 --> 00:00:33,464
I'm not sure what
'll happen there

6
00:00:33,504 --> 00:00:34,869
You do know how
to use that gun

7
00:00:34,909 --> 00:00:35,790
right？

8
00:00:37,057 --> 00:00:37,658
Hmm？

9
00:00:37,698 --> 00:00:38,459
Calvin Street

10
00:00:38,499 --> 00:00:39,740
Frankfurt，now？

11
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:41,421
My plans
have changed

12
00:00:41,461 --> 00:00:42,942
Why the sudden
change of heart？

13
00:00:42,982 --> 00:00:44,464
What about
killing Johann？

14
00:00:44,504 --> 00:00:45,705
I'll deal
with him later

15
00:00:45,745 --> 00:00:46,986
now do as I say

16
00:00:47,026 --> 00:00:49,828
General Wolf will
be disappointed to hear this news

17
00:00:49,868 --> 00:00:52,150
He personally
requested that you kill Johann

18
00:00:52,190 --> 00:00:54,231
He believed you
were the man for the job

19
00:00:54,472 --> 00:00:55,792
I don't care

20
00:00:56,113 --> 00:00:58,435
I don't take
requests from anyone

21
00:00:58,475 --> 00:01:00,877
I'm gonna kill
Johann of my own accord

22
00:01:00,917 --> 00:01:03,439
Now hurry up and
get to Calvin Street

23
00:02:36,915 --> 00:02:38,439
All ignition
points are ready to go

24
00:02:38,479 --> 00:02:39,160
sir

25
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:41,085
awaiting your
orders to proceed

26
00:02:41,125 --> 00:02:42,488
Well done

27
00:02:42,528 --> 00:02:46,577
time to celebrate
our superiority with a little firepower

28
00:02:49,461 --> 00:02:50,341
Now

29
00:02:50,381 --> 00:02:52,102
What are we
gonna do with them？

30
00:02:52,142 --> 00:02:54,783
These two are an
insult to our race

31
00:02:54,823 --> 00:02:55,904
Unfortunately

32
00:02:55,944 --> 00:02:58,145
these types do
exist among us

33
00:02:58,185 --> 00:02:59,305
One is a thief

34
00:02:59,345 --> 00:03:01,787
and the brat was
trying to save the Turks

35
00:03:01,827 --> 00:03:04,027
They're both
filthy scum

36
00:03:04,188 --> 00:03:05,748
Purify them

37
00:03:05,949 --> 00:03:07,830
It's time to
teach them a lesson

38
00:03:07,870 --> 00:03:09,590
This place is
gonna burn anyway

39
00:03:09,630 --> 00:03:11,351
Leave them
for the flames

40
00:03:16,540 --> 00:03:17,262
Oh，come on

41
00:03:17,302 --> 00:03:17,864
little one

42
00:03:17,904 --> 00:03:18,466
don't cry

43
00:03:18,506 --> 00:03:21,835
Your mom is
coming back real soon

44
00:03:22,519 --> 00:03:23,319
阿契

45
00:03:23,402 --> 00:03:24,082
哎…

46
00:03:30,083 --> 00:03:32,244
I can't believe
you're still alive

47
00:03:33,005 --> 00:03:34,246
How'd you find me？

48
00:03:34,286 --> 00:03:35,567
It's all
thanks to Dieter

49
00:03:35,607 --> 00:03:37,449
He told me that
you lived in this building

50
00:03:37,489 --> 00:03:38,650
Did you
say Dieter？

51
00:03:38,690 --> 00:03:40,571
So then it's true
you're that Tenma guy

52
00:03:40,611 --> 00:03:42,853
He was talking to
me about the other day

53
00:03:43,013 --> 00:03:44,294
Where is Dieter？

54
00:03:44,334 --> 00:03:45,495
Didn't he come by？

55
00:03:45,535 --> 00:03:46,295
Uh…

56
00:03:46,416 --> 00:03:47,176
no

57
00:03:47,257 --> 00:03:48,937
Then where
'd he go？

58
00:03:48,978 --> 00:03:50,659
Hey，have you
seen Aishé？

59
00:03:51,300 --> 00:03:53,461
This baby is
Aishé's little boy

60
00:03:53,501 --> 00:03:54,222
He needs her

61
00:03:54,262 --> 00:03:56,183
he misses
his mom a lot

62
00:04:01,627 --> 00:04:02,908
It can't be

63
00:04:03,069 --> 00:04:03,630
No

64
00:04:03,670 --> 00:04:04,991
it's not possible

65
00:04:05,031 --> 00:04:06,273
I don't believe it

66
00:04:06,313 --> 00:04:07,995
What about this
poor little child？

67
00:04:08,035 --> 00:04:09,877
He's too young to
be without a mother

68
00:04:09,917 --> 00:04:11,359
What am I
going to do？

69
00:04:11,399 --> 00:04:12,800
What do I do？

70
00:04:14,163 --> 00:04:15,644
She's the last

71
00:04:16,125 --> 00:04:18,488
There mustn't be
any more victims

72
00:04:18,889 --> 00:04:21,892
I need to see the
leaders of the Turkish quarter now

73
00:04:30,601 --> 00:04:32,321
So what does
everyone think？

74
00:04:32,361 --> 00:04:33,601
Set the
town on fire

75
00:04:33,641 --> 00:04:34,201
huh？

76
00:04:34,241 --> 00:04:35,521
Not likely

77
00:04:35,561 --> 00:04:38,841
We hear rumours
about the right wing extremists all the time

78
00:04:38,881 --> 00:04:41,721
We can't overreact every time they threaten us

79
00:04:41,761 --> 00:04:45,400
What's even more suspicious to me is this Japanese guy waltzing in here

80
00:04:45,440 --> 00:04:47,720
though he says
his life is in danger

81
00:04:47,960 --> 00:04:49,202
What's the matter
with all of you？

82
00:04:49,242 --> 00:04:50,162
Aisha is dead

83
00:04:50,202 --> 00:04:51,003
don't you get it？

84
00:04:51,043 --> 00:04:54,286
She was killed because she tried to warn all of us about this danger

85
00:04:54,326 --> 00:04:56,087
I wonder
about that

86
00:04:56,127 --> 00:04:57,768
She was a
prostitute like you

87
00:04:57,808 --> 00:04:58,649
right？

88
00:04:58,689 --> 00:05:02,172
You women go off
with Germans all the time and end up missing

89
00:05:02,212 --> 00:05:03,493
That's nothing new

90
00:05:03,533 --> 00:05:05,934
You make all us
Turks look bad

91
00:05:06,736 --> 00:05:09,738
How do we really
know whose kid that is anyway？

92
00:05:11,308 --> 00:05:13,471
You all know how
hard it is to make a living

93
00:05:13,511 --> 00:05:15,794
You should know
better than to act like this

94
00:05:15,834 --> 00:05:17,397
If you
want to live

95
00:05:17,437 --> 00:05:19,518
and you've got
to listen to me

96
00:05:20,641 --> 00:05:21,362
Forget it

97
00:05:21,402 --> 00:05:22,363
do what you want

98
00:05:22,403 --> 00:05:25,086
You can burn and
go to hell for all I care

99
00:05:25,207 --> 00:05:27,890
Now wait
just one second

100
00:05:29,083 --> 00:05:31,763
Are you suggesting patrol groups？

101
00:05:31,803 --> 00:05:34,483
Maybe we should
do as this Japanese man says

102
00:05:34,523 --> 00:05:35,883
We have
nothing to lose

103
00:05:35,923 --> 00:05:37,123
Mr， Fanny's

104
00:05:37,163 --> 00:05:40,403
Are you really
going to listen to some Asian we don't know？

105
00:05:40,443 --> 00:05:42,483
He might be
suspicious

106
00:05:42,523 --> 00:05:47,803
But there are certainly plenty of trustworthy Japanese people in the world

107
00:05:47,884 --> 00:05:49,044
General Nogi

108
00:05:49,084 --> 00:05:50,004
for example

109
00:05:50,044 --> 00:05:51,365
General Nogi？

110
00:05:51,405 --> 00:05:52,286
Who's he？

111
00:05:52,326 --> 00:05:54,686
You mean you don'
t know about him？

112
00:05:54,767 --> 00:05:57,528
General Nogi was
a brave Japanese man

113
00:05:57,568 --> 00:05:59,129
who saved the
Turkish Navy

114
00:05:59,169 --> 00:06:01,969
when they were
lost in the Pacific years ago

115
00:06:04,371 --> 00:06:07,452
Go ahead and
gather all our men immediately

116
00:06:09,383 --> 00:06:11,623
It looks
so delicious

117
00:06:12,543 --> 00:06:13,343
Let's dig in

118
00:06:13,383 --> 00:06:14,303
shall we？

119
00:06:14,343 --> 00:06:15,943
No need to be
in such a hurry

120
00:06:15,983 --> 00:06:16,702
ladies

121
00:06:16,742 --> 00:06:18,222
Take your time

122
00:06:18,902 --> 00:06:22,422
We wouldn't want
to finish eating before the entertainment

123
00:06:22,462 --> 00:06:25,341
I planned it so
by the time the main course comes around

124
00:06:25,381 --> 00:06:27,541
The show will be
reaching its climax

125
00:06:27,581 --> 00:06:28,461
In the meantime

126
00:06:28,501 --> 00:06:30,901
let's enjoy this
76 chateau le tour

127
00:06:30,941 --> 00:06:33,340
I saved especially for this night

128
00:06:36,706 --> 00:06:40,032
The first dish we
will indulge in is my favourite

129
00:06:40,072 --> 00:06:42,596
raw flounder
with caviar

130
00:06:45,122 --> 00:06:47,365
And as the
feast begins

131
00:06:49,219 --> 00:06:49,980
Voilà

132
00:06:50,020 --> 00:06:51,501
the first fire

133
00:06:51,541 --> 00:06:53,423
What a
wonderful start

134
00:06:53,463 --> 00:06:54,584
But like
I told you

135
00:06:54,624 --> 00:06:56,946
that's still
just an appetizer

136
00:06:57,147 --> 00:06:59,028
Where is the
main course？

137
00:06:59,189 --> 00:07:00,510
Remember
what I said

138
00:07:00,550 --> 00:07:02,072
don't be impatient

139
00:07:02,112 --> 00:07:03,633
If you
savour your dinner

140
00:07:03,673 --> 00:07:06,676
my show will be
something you'll truly enjoy

141
00:07:07,557 --> 00:07:09,679
Tell me where
the main course is

142
00:07:10,520 --> 00:07:12,441
If that's
an appetizer？

143
00:07:13,202 --> 00:07:15,921
Then what are you
gonna burn for the main course？

144
00:07:17,401 --> 00:07:19,720
We need more
fire extinguishers

145
00:07:20,760 --> 00:07:21,919
We need to
spread out

146
00:07:21,959 --> 00:07:22,919
the rest
of you men

147
00:07:22,959 --> 00:07:24,199
come with me

148
00:07:24,799 --> 00:07:25,840
It's just
as I thought

149
00:07:25,880 --> 00:07:27,603
the flames
started upwind

150
00:07:27,643 --> 00:07:29,045
This whole
place could go up

151
00:07:29,085 --> 00:07:29,766
Three groups

152
00:07:29,806 --> 00:07:31,328
save the
women and children

153
00:07:31,368 --> 00:07:32,610
My goodness

154
00:07:32,650 --> 00:07:34,012
what a
lovely surprise

155
00:07:34,052 --> 00:07:35,534
And to what do we
owe this honour？

156
00:07:35,574 --> 00:07:36,135
Why you old bat？

157
00:07:36,175 --> 00:07:37,616
Don't even try it

158
00:07:37,737 --> 00:07:39,460
or kiss your
boss goodbye

159
00:07:39,500 --> 00:07:41,862
Put that
dangerous thing away

160
00:07:41,983 --> 00:07:44,586
Why don't we
enjoy this meal together？

161
00:07:45,525 --> 00:07:46,366
Unfortunately

162
00:07:46,406 --> 00:07:49,050
it seems your
appetiser is fizzling out

163
00:07:50,334 --> 00:07:51,056
Don't worry

164
00:07:51,096 --> 00:07:53,018
that was just
the beginning

165
00:07:55,465 --> 00:07:56,547
This is
your favourite

166
00:07:56,587 --> 00:07:57,467
right？

167
00:07:58,828 --> 00:08:00,350
Sorry about that

168
00:08:00,471 --> 00:08:01,993
Don't be
so contrary

169
00:08:02,033 --> 00:08:02,954
my dear

170
00:08:02,994 --> 00:08:04,556
You see，after all

171
00:08:04,596 --> 00:08:06,479
this is a
great celebration

172
00:08:06,519 --> 00:08:08,321
In honour
of Johann

173
00:08:08,361 --> 00:08:08,962
Listen to me

174
00:08:09,002 --> 00:08:11,246
Johann doesn't
want any of this

175
00:08:11,286 --> 00:08:12,327
Oh？

176
00:08:12,367 --> 00:08:13,128
And tell me

177
00:08:13,168 --> 00:08:15,291
how can you
be so certain？

178
00:08:15,331 --> 00:08:17,176
I saw it
with my own eyes

179
00:08:17,216 --> 00:08:18,459
I followed
his messages

180
00:08:18,499 --> 00:08:20,301
I know
what he wants

181
00:08:20,624 --> 00:08:23,309
Yohann doesn't
care about your plans

182
00:08:23,631 --> 00:08:24,431
So

183
00:08:24,593 --> 00:08:26,636
what exactly
did you see？

184
00:08:28,202 --> 00:08:29,243
Yohann？

185
00:08:30,833 --> 00:08:32,313
He doesn't
want any of this

186
00:08:32,353 --> 00:08:33,593
don't you
understand？

187
00:08:33,633 --> 00:08:35,233
You're right，okay

188
00:08:35,273 --> 00:08:36,713
relax，calm down

189
00:08:36,753 --> 00:08:37,713
just take it easy

190
00:08:37,753 --> 00:08:39,913
Aishé is dead
because of you

191
00:08:40,033 --> 00:08:42,353
I won't let
anybody else die tonight

192
00:08:42,393 --> 00:08:44,073
So where's
the main course？

193
00:08:44,113 --> 00:08:47,033
What part of town
are you going to set on fire？

194
00:08:49,273 --> 00:08:50,153
Damn it

195
00:08:50,193 --> 00:08:53,072
They started fires where the fire trucks can't get to

196
00:08:54,712 --> 00:08:56,032
Take the injured
to the shelters

197
00:08:56,072 --> 00:08:57,472
I'll be
right there

198
00:08:57,512 --> 00:08:58,553
Tenma

199
00:08:59,116 --> 00:09:00,921
Have you had any
luck finding Dieder？

200
00:09:00,961 --> 00:09:05,210
Someone told me they saw a kid who looked like him near the park around noon

201
00:09:06,053 --> 00:09:07,575
Dieder，my god

202
00:09:21,853 --> 00:09:22,093
Hey

203
00:09:22,133 --> 00:09:24,934
Shouldn't we go
after her and try and bring her back？

204
00:09:25,174 --> 00:09:25,974
No

205
00:09:26,375 --> 00:09:29,656
let's just continue with my dinner as planned

206
00:09:29,696 --> 00:09:31,697
That girl
sure is something

207
00:09:31,737 --> 00:09:34,298
I suppose it must
run in the family

208
00:09:35,498 --> 00:09:37,739
The look she
had in her eyes

209
00:09:38,459 --> 00:09:40,820
She was really
going to kill me

210
00:09:41,261 --> 00:09:43,023
It's a good thing
she didn't realise

211
00:09:43,063 --> 00:09:47,307
how close I was to giving her the actual location of the main course

212
00:09:47,347 --> 00:09:47,628
Well

213
00:09:47,668 --> 00:09:49,510
shall we bring
out the next dessert？

214
00:09:49,550 --> 00:09:50,310
No

215
00:09:50,671 --> 00:09:52,793
eat me some
underwear first

216
00:09:56,397 --> 00:09:57,478
Huh？Scary girl

217
00:09:57,518 --> 00:09:58,559
isn't she？

218
00:10:17,547 --> 00:10:18,947
Hang on

219
00:10:19,347 --> 00:10:20,307
我會去熄火

220
00:10:30,947 --> 00:10:31,869
You made it

221
00:10:31,909 --> 00:10:33,511
you're going
to be just fine

222
00:10:33,551 --> 00:10:34,513
Everything's okay

223
00:10:34,553 --> 00:10:35,074
alright？

224
00:10:35,114 --> 00:10:36,877
I got no idea
who you are， lady

225
00:10:36,917 --> 00:10:38,599
but thanks for
getting us out of there

226
00:10:38,639 --> 00:10:40,162
How did the two
of you end up here

227
00:10:40,202 --> 00:10:41,323
anyway？

228
00:10:41,644 --> 00:10:42,645
Well， I…

229
00:10:43,447 --> 00:10:44,569
You wanna know
what happened

230
00:10:44,609 --> 00:10:45,290
lady？

231
00:10:45,330 --> 00:10:47,813
This brat
almost got me killed

232
00:10:48,174 --> 00:10:49,575
Forget this

233
00:10:49,615 --> 00:10:51,575
I'm getting the
hell outta here

234
00:10:51,615 --> 00:10:53,976
If that was the
smallest fire those skinheads set

235
00:10:54,016 --> 00:10:56,136
I wouldn't be
a bit surprised

236
00:10:57,737 --> 00:10:59,138
I grew up in
this neighbourhood

237
00:10:59,178 --> 00:11:01,458
I know the place
like the back of my hand

238
00:11:01,498 --> 00:11:03,179
If I wanted to
burn down the town

239
00:11:03,219 --> 00:11:04,379
This wouldn'
t be the spot

240
00:11:04,419 --> 00:11:05,739
believe you me

241
00:11:07,380 --> 00:11:09,981
This town ain't
outta the woods just yet

242
00:11:15,038 --> 00:11:18,241
There were three
other fires upwind that were also put out

243
00:11:18,281 --> 00:11:20,563
We can't thank
you enough for your help

244
00:11:20,603 --> 00:11:21,724
Right，everyone？

245
00:11:21,764 --> 00:11:22,445
Yeah

246
00:11:22,485 --> 00:11:23,486
if it weren
't for you

247
00:11:23,526 --> 00:11:25,728
this all could've
been a whole lot worse

248
00:11:25,768 --> 00:11:28,210
Our next step is
to take care of the injured

249
00:11:28,250 --> 00:11:28,771
No

250
00:11:28,811 --> 00:11:30,372
I won't have
any more victims

251
00:11:30,412 --> 00:11:31,813
not one more

252
00:11:32,174 --> 00:11:32,854
Wait

253
00:11:32,894 --> 00:11:34,615
what are you
talking about？Well

254
00:11:34,655 --> 00:11:36,775
the wind's gonna
change direction

255
00:11:36,935 --> 00:11:39,176
It always happens
every night around this time

256
00:11:39,216 --> 00:11:40,617
The wind
just stops

257
00:11:40,657 --> 00:11:43,858
then it starts
blowing towards town from where the river is

258
00:11:50,501 --> 00:11:51,661
The wind？

259
00:11:52,101 --> 00:11:53,382
It stopped？

260
00:11:55,859 --> 00:11:57,179
And now

261
00:11:58,260 --> 00:12:01,182
time for the main
course to be served

262
00:12:04,505 --> 00:12:05,666
You see them
running away？

263
00:12:05,706 --> 00:12:06,306
Yes

264
00:12:06,346 --> 00:12:08,467
allow me to
buy this round

265
00:12:08,508 --> 00:12:09,388
Okay

266
00:12:09,428 --> 00:12:10,789
that should
take care of it

267
00:12:10,829 --> 00:12:12,029
Thanks for
patching me up

268
00:12:12,069 --> 00:12:12,870
Doctor

269
00:12:12,910 --> 00:12:14,510
Let me buy
you a drink

270
00:12:14,550 --> 00:12:15,631
What are you
talking about？

271
00:12:15,671 --> 00:12:17,592
You have to take
it easy for a while

272
00:12:17,632 --> 00:12:18,712
Oh，come on

273
00:12:18,752 --> 00:12:19,953
loosen up，Doctor

274
00:12:19,993 --> 00:12:20,553
right？

275
00:12:20,593 --> 00:12:21,233
That's right

276
00:12:21,273 --> 00:12:22,113
it's thanks to you

277
00:12:22,153 --> 00:12:23,954
we were able to
put out those fires

278
00:12:23,994 --> 00:12:25,475
and save the
neighbourhood

279
00:12:25,515 --> 00:12:28,436
I bet those neo
Nazis are scratching their heads right now

280
00:12:28,476 --> 00:12:30,037
wondering what
the hell happened

281
00:12:30,077 --> 00:12:31,077
No doubt they are

282
00:12:31,117 --> 00:12:34,198
that'll teach 'em
never underestimate the Turks

283
00:12:35,159 --> 00:12:37,960
Where are they
tending to all the other injured people？

284
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:39,680
The mosque
by the river

285
00:12:41,321 --> 00:12:42,402
Hey，Doctor Tenma

286
00:12:42,442 --> 00:12:43,962
take a break
and relax，Come on

287
00:12:44,002 --> 00:12:45,923
why don't you
have a drink with us？

288
00:12:45,963 --> 00:12:48,244
Not until everyone
's taken care of

289
00:12:49,342 --> 00:12:52,346
If all of the
fires up until now were just diversions

290
00:12:52,386 --> 00:12:54,589
Where do you think they're going to light the real fire？

291
00:12:54,629 --> 00:12:56,031
How the hell
would I know？

292
00:12:56,071 --> 00:12:58,713
Who cares about
this stupid town anyway？

293
00:12:58,955 --> 00:12:59,515
Besides

294
00:12:59,555 --> 00:13:02,960
there's something much more important on my mind that I gotta take care of

295
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:03,601
Wait

296
00:13:03,641 --> 00:13:04,722
I need you
to tell me

297
00:13:04,762 --> 00:13:06,324
and I need you
to tell me now

298
00:13:06,364 --> 00:13:08,367
Where would you
start the real fire？

299
00:13:08,407 --> 00:13:10,249
Get your
hands off of me

300
00:13:10,289 --> 00:13:11,611
Like I
already told ya

301
00:13:11,651 --> 00:13:13,773
the wind's gonna
come from the river

302
00:13:13,854 --> 00:13:17,978
The abandoned factory down there would be a perfect place for a fire

303
00:13:18,018 --> 00:13:18,858
If I'm
not mistaken

304
00:13:18,898 --> 00:13:21,980
there should still be a bunch of chemicals in the warehouse

305
00:13:26,385 --> 00:13:28,266
At long last

306
00:13:28,306 --> 00:13:31,308
something I can
sink my teeth into

307
00:13:31,829 --> 00:13:32,710
Yes

308
00:13:32,750 --> 00:13:35,192
this is going
to be delicious

309
00:13:39,636 --> 00:13:41,517
We're right
on schedule

310
00:13:41,557 --> 00:13:45,120
The celebration
of the master race is about to begin

311
00:14:02,584 --> 00:14:03,624
It's you

312
00:14:04,024 --> 00:14:05,425
Why did you
follow me？

313
00:14:05,465 --> 00:14:07,467
Because I have to
put out the fire

314
00:14:07,507 --> 00:14:09,547
I made a
promise to Tenma

315
00:14:10,669 --> 00:14:11,749
Tenma？

316
00:14:21,195 --> 00:14:22,236
This is it

317
00:14:22,276 --> 00:14:23,876
It's the warehouse

318
00:14:24,793 --> 00:14:26,114
Thank goodness

319
00:14:26,155 --> 00:14:28,478
looks like they
haven't found this place yet

320
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:31,443
These are all
filled with chemicals？

321
00:14:31,483 --> 00:14:32,684
If all of this
were to go up

322
00:14:32,724 --> 00:14:33,926
it'd be hopeless

323
00:14:33,966 --> 00:14:36,128
There'd be
nothing left of the town

324
00:14:36,810 --> 00:14:38,653
I'll protect this
place no matter what

325
00:14:38,693 --> 00:14:41,336
I'm not gonna let
those horrible people burn it down

326
00:14:41,376 --> 00:14:43,700
You okay？

327
00:14:43,740 --> 00:14:45,101
I slipped

328
00:14:45,903 --> 00:14:47,704
What the
heck is this？

329
00:14:51,873 --> 00:14:53,794
Smells
like gasoline

330
00:14:58,678 --> 00:14:59,998
It looks like…

331
00:15:00,519 --> 00:15:01,920
someone's there

332
00:15:02,721 --> 00:15:03,481
It's alright

333
00:15:03,521 --> 00:15:04,562
I'm fine

334
00:15:04,602 --> 00:15:06,203
I can walk
on my own

335
00:15:06,243 --> 00:15:09,245
Let's get you to
a shelter so I can have a closer look at it

336
00:15:09,285 --> 00:15:10,726
I twisted my ankle

337
00:15:10,766 --> 00:15:14,449
It probably happened when I was trying to get away from the fire

338
00:15:17,213 --> 00:15:18,816
Now that I
finally got this rug

339
00:15:18,856 --> 00:15:21,661
who gives a damn
about this stinking town？

340
00:15:21,701 --> 00:15:23,623
I bet I can
probably get 800

341
00:15:23,784 --> 00:15:24,786
000 marks
for this baby

342
00:15:24,826 --> 00:15:25,988
No，a million

343
00:15:26,028 --> 00:15:26,989
Herkel

344
00:15:32,546 --> 00:15:34,187
What happened to Dieter？

345
00:15:34,228 --> 00:15:35,109
Couldn't say

346
00:15:35,149 --> 00:15:36,030
he's probably…

347
00:15:36,070 --> 00:15:36,630
Where is he？

348
00:15:36,670 --> 00:15:37,231
Where'd he go？

349
00:15:37,271 --> 00:15:38,792
What happened to him？

350
00:15:39,153 --> 00:15:39,994
Last I saw

351
00:15:40,034 --> 00:15:42,996
he was going to
the abandoned warehouse by the river

352
00:15:43,077 --> 00:15:44,198
Why there？

353
00:15:44,238 --> 00:15:46,961
The wind's gonna
blow in from the river soon

354
00:15:47,001 --> 00:15:49,523
So if the chemicals in that warehouse are set on fire

355
00:15:49,563 --> 00:15:51,565
it's all over
for this town

356
00:15:55,982 --> 00:15:58,104
This is what I
was talking about

357
00:15:59,107 --> 00:16:02,633
Tell everyone to
evacuate from the riverside shelters right away

358
00:16:02,673 --> 00:16:03,434
Go

359
00:16:04,597 --> 00:16:06,559
You're going
to take me there

360
00:16:10,928 --> 00:16:12,049
Who is it？

361
00:16:12,531 --> 00:16:13,932
Who's back there？

362
00:16:31,809 --> 00:16:33,491
Freeze，don't move

363
00:16:33,612 --> 00:16:35,054
Can it be true？

364
00:16:35,094 --> 00:16:37,097
Are you really
Johann's sister？

365
00:16:37,137 --> 00:16:38,979
Put the
lighter down now

366
00:16:39,100 --> 00:16:42,303
Once I set this
trail of gasoline on fire

367
00:16:42,384 --> 00:16:45,469
This warehouse is
going to go up in an instant

368
00:16:45,509 --> 00:16:48,032
I'm going to shoot you in the head before that happens

369
00:16:48,072 --> 00:16:50,075
I can fire quicker than you can flick that lighter

370
00:16:50,115 --> 00:16:51,597
and I'm not
afraid to do it

371
00:16:51,637 --> 00:16:53,159
And what
if you miss？

372
00:16:53,199 --> 00:16:56,363
I haven't skipped
a day of training in six months straight

373
00:16:56,403 --> 00:16:59,407
So I know I can
hit you from here

374
00:16:59,447 --> 00:17:01,009
You don't
frighten me

375
00:17:01,090 --> 00:17:02,051
Don't you know？

376
00:17:02,091 --> 00:17:04,454
This is a celebration of the master race

377
00:17:04,494 --> 00:17:06,737
This is our big
welcome for Johann

378
00:17:06,777 --> 00:17:09,901
But Johann doesn'
t want any of the things you want

379
00:17:10,870 --> 00:17:11,230
Yes

380
00:17:11,270 --> 00:17:14,351
it's true that he
was recently seen here in Frankfort

381
00:17:14,391 --> 00:17:19,311
But the only reason he came was to kill one of your leaders and all of his subordinates

382
00:17:19,351 --> 00:17:20,631
He left a
message behind

383
00:17:20,671 --> 00:17:21,672
you know

384
00:17:22,032 --> 00:17:23,272
What message？

385
00:17:23,312 --> 00:17:24,192
Listen to me

386
00:17:24,232 --> 00:17:27,032
Johan is not the
person you think he is

387
00:17:27,352 --> 00:17:30,115
The truth is much
more complex than that

388
00:17:30,155 --> 00:17:31,916
What are you
trying to say？

389
00:17:31,956 --> 00:17:33,037
It's worse

390
00:17:33,077 --> 00:17:35,399
it must be
terrifying for him

391
00:17:35,440 --> 00:17:36,440
He's suffering

392
00:17:36,480 --> 00:17:39,402
he's in anguish
and teetering on the edge of despair

393
00:17:43,126 --> 00:17:45,048
You know I'm not
so sure it's such a good idea

394
00:17:45,088 --> 00:17:47,050
To be making
enemies of these guys

395
00:17:47,090 --> 00:17:48,851
Which way to
the warehouse？

396
00:17:48,891 --> 00:17:51,173
I didn't sign on
for all of this

397
00:17:52,518 --> 00:17:54,120
I'm gonna call
it a day，see ya

398
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:55,722
Where the hell do
you think you're going？

399
00:17:55,762 --> 00:17:57,724
Are you just
going to let Dino die like that？

400
00:17:57,764 --> 00:17:59,005
Tell me where
the warehouse is

401
00:17:59,045 --> 00:18:00,006
Alright
I'll tell you

402
00:18:00,046 --> 00:18:00,567
I'll tell you

403
00:18:00,607 --> 00:18:01,488
just let me go

404
00:18:01,528 --> 00:18:02,928
you're choking me

405
00:18:04,567 --> 00:18:06,246
You told me
about your friend

406
00:18:06,286 --> 00:18:07,646
You said that
his name is Tenma

407
00:18:07,686 --> 00:18:08,566
right？

408
00:18:09,126 --> 00:18:12,445
Would you believe
that I know a man whose name is Tenma also？

409
00:18:12,485 --> 00:18:13,445
For real？

410
00:18:13,485 --> 00:18:15,645
Is your Tenma
really brave too？

411
00:18:15,725 --> 00:18:16,525
Yes

412
00:18:16,725 --> 00:18:18,565
but he must
never fire a gun

413
00:18:18,605 --> 00:18:20,525
not if I can
do it for him

414
00:18:20,644 --> 00:18:22,084
I don't want
him to kill anyone

415
00:18:22,124 --> 00:18:23,524
he's a good man

416
00:18:23,644 --> 00:18:25,164
Killing people
is always wrong

417
00:18:25,204 --> 00:18:26,564
you understand？

418
00:18:26,684 --> 00:18:28,443
Even if they'
re the bad guys？

419
00:18:28,483 --> 00:18:29,403
Right

420
00:18:29,523 --> 00:18:31,803
Don't ever do
what I'm about to do

421
00:18:33,733 --> 00:18:34,615
Close your eyes

422
00:18:34,655 --> 00:18:35,896
don't look

423
00:18:37,660 --> 00:18:39,102
Don't shoot

424
00:18:43,270 --> 00:18:44,351
Tenma

425
00:18:56,083 --> 00:18:56,684
Quick，Hekko

426
00:18:56,724 --> 00:18:58,205
put out the fire

427
00:18:58,245 --> 00:18:59,207
Use the rock，hurry

428
00:18:59,247 --> 00:19:04,371
No

429
00:19:04,612 --> 00:19:05,173
Not the rock

430
00:19:05,213 --> 00:19:06,774
not the rock

431
00:19:18,176 --> 00:19:20,297
1 million marks

432
00:19:20,538 --> 00:19:23,621
gone

433
00:19:23,661 --> 00:19:24,461
Nina

434
00:19:25,783 --> 00:19:26,864
Tenma

435
00:19:32,510 --> 00:19:34,272
Damn it， all the
cops are coming

436
00:19:34,312 --> 00:19:35,633
Get out， go

437
00:19:35,673 --> 00:19:37,195
I'll take care
of things here

438
00:19:37,235 --> 00:19:39,157
There's a boat
over by the river

439
00:19:39,197 --> 00:19:39,958
Please， Tenma

440
00:19:39,998 --> 00:19:41,559
you have
to leave now

441
00:19:45,705 --> 00:19:51,348
Hmm

442
00:19:51,388 --> 00:19:52,988
My main course

443
00:19:53,229 --> 00:19:54,989
it got cold

444
00:20:01,472 --> 00:20:03,033
Thank you for all
your cooperation

445
00:20:03,073 --> 00:20:04,034
young lady

446
00:20:04,074 --> 00:20:06,875
We'd appreciate
it if you'd come down to the station

447
00:20:08,075 --> 00:20:09,076
Wait one second
okay

448
00:20:09,116 --> 00:20:10,316
I'll be right back

449
00:20:10,356 --> 00:20:11,837
Hey，hold on

450
00:20:24,317 --> 00:20:25,157
車馬

451
00:20:25,197 --> 00:20:27,876
Nina

452
00:20:28,796 --> 00:20:30,358
You have to
promise me something

453
00:20:30,398 --> 00:20:31,358
Nina

454
00:20:31,399 --> 00:20:33,801
Swear to me you
won't kill anyone

455
00:20:33,841 --> 00:20:35,082
I saw it

456
00:20:35,243 --> 00:20:36,564
I saw your
aunt's message

457
00:20:36,604 --> 00:20:37,885
I saw it too

458
00:20:37,925 --> 00:20:39,446
I'm heading there now

459
00:20:39,967 --> 00:20:41,248
Ten years ago

460
00:20:41,288 --> 00:20:43,050
the night I
shot my brother

461
00:20:43,090 --> 00:20:44,732
I finally know
what he meant

462
00:20:44,772 --> 00:20:46,854
When he told me
to shoot him in the head

463
00:20:46,894 --> 00:20:48,535
Now I understand

464
00:20:50,097 --> 00:20:52,538
Yohani，他…

465
00:20:52,738 --> 00:20:54,859
他唔係一個人，有兩個喺入面

466
00:21:07,305 --> 00:21:08,505
That's why…

467
00:21:08,746 --> 00:21:10,026
Dr， Tenma

468
00:21:10,306 --> 00:21:11,947
It wasn't
your fault

469
00:21:12,067 --> 00:21:14,108
You didn't do
anything wrong

470
00:21:18,079 --> 00:21:19,200
我必須做呢件事，我沒有其他選擇

471
00:21:19,240 --> 00:21:20,321
我必須再射中約翰

472
00:21:36,534 --> 00:21:37,935
Hey，wait up

473
00:21:37,975 --> 00:21:40,017
What the hell are
we doing here anyway？

474
00:21:40,057 --> 00:21:41,698
Come on
let's get out of here

475
00:21:41,738 --> 00:21:43,420
Gotta give up

476
00:21:43,460 --> 00:21:45,342
There's no use
with this guy

477
00:21:45,382 --> 00:21:47,823
I guess I'll be
starving and broke forever

478
00:21:48,464 --> 00:21:50,746
If only I
still had that rug

479
00:21:50,786 --> 00:21:51,867
Damn it

480
00:21:57,152 --> 00:21:59,113
The hell's that
supposed to be？

481
00:22:01,116 --> 00:22:01,876
It's…

482
00:22:01,916 --> 00:22:03,397
a message

483
00:22:13,782 --> 00:22:14,742
Help

484
00:22:15,543 --> 00:22:17,624
The monster
inside me…

485
00:22:18,305 --> 00:22:20,546
is about
to explode

486
00:22:21,947 --> 00:22:23,908
What is this
supposed to mean？

487
00:22:24,068 --> 00:22:26,229
He has a
split personality？

